    "romaji": "Shinjiteita Nakamatachi ni Dungeon Okuchi de Korosarekaketa ga Gift \"Mugen Gacha\" de Level 9999 no Nakamatachi wo Te ni Irete Moto Party Member to Sekai ni Fukushuu & \"Zamaa!\" Shimasu!",
